WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.650
Luke dashes toward Ryu after the prerequisite target knockdown.

2
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:01.250
Standing heavy kick hits Ryu as he rises.

3
00:00:01.250 --> 00:00:02.000
Crouching heavy punch links after heavy kick.

4
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:02.850
Perfect medium Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

5
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:03.600
Jumping medium punch catches Ryu during the carry.

6
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:04.400
The delayed short-held air light Knuckle continues the juggle.

7
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:05.350
Light Rising Uppercut finishes as Ryu reaches the wall.

8
00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:06.600
Ryu finishes the knockdown at the corner.
